                                                "sense_id": "70c1517b-f74b-3788-be6a-9c9d9b4f667b",
                                                "text": "The donor power car, owned by SR, will then be removed from Haymarket depot and disposed of. It has already been stripped of reusable components for the IC7 power cars north of the border."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13a00fc8-81a7-31e6-844a-c480f58741da",
                                        "entry_id": "9d39bf31-1b3f-3834-a4a8-23d9b59c758e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(of a program) Able to be executed by several tasks without being reloaded; either reentrant or serially reusable"
                                        ],
